<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard Estudiante</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/5.15.4/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* Body y fondo */
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0a192f; /* Azul marino oscuro */
            margin: 0;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617016327123-eedfaed18ca1'); /* Imagen de fondo */
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        /* Barra superior */
        .head {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .head .logo a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Barra de navegación */
        .navbar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .navbar a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .navbar a:hover {
            background-color: #00bcd4; /* Azul celeste */
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .navbar .logout-form button {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 1em;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* Contenedor del dashboard */
        .dashboard-container {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px auto;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .dashboard-container h2 {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: rgb(255, 119, 0); /* Naranja brillante */
            font-size: 3em;
        }

        .dashboard-container p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #eee;
        }

        /* Botones principales */
        .dashboard-btn {
            background-color: #00bcd4;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px 50px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .dashboard-btn:hover {
            background-color: #00a3b7;
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        /* Estilo de tarjeta para CTF */
        .frame-item {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 300px;
            margin: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .frame-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .frame-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .frame-item h3 {
            color: rgb(255, 119, 0); /* Naranja brillante */
        }

        .frame-item p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .read-more-button {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: rgb(255, 119, 0);
            border: 1px solid rgb(255, 119, 0);
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .read-more-button:hover {
            background-color: rgb(255, 119, 0);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: rgb(255, 119, 0);
        }

        /* Sección de CTF */
        .test-block {
            background-color: #fff;
            border-left: 4px solid rgb(255, 119, 0);
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            color: #333;
        }

        .test-block h4 {
            color: rgb(255, 119, 0);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.5em;
        }

        .test-block p {
            color: #666;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Responsividad */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .head {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }

            .navbar {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }

            .dashboard-container {
                width: 90%;
                padding: 30px;
            }

            .dashboard-btn {
                padding: 15px 40px;
                font-size: 1.2em;
            }

            .frame-item {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="head">
        <div class="logo">
            <a href="#">Synapse CTF</a>
        </div>
        <nav class="navbar">
            <a href="#">Ir a Pruebas</a>
            <a href="#">Ver Reportes</a>
            <a href="#">Dashboard CTF</a>
            <form action="{{ route('logout') }}" method="POST" class="logout-form">
                @csrf
                <button type="submit" class="navbar-item">Cerrar Sesión</button>
            </form>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="dashboard-container">
        <h2>Bienvenido, {{ Auth::user()->name }}</h2>
        <p>Aquí puedes ver tu progreso y acceder a las diferentes secciones relacionadas con CTF.</p>

        <!-- Botones principales -->
        <a href="#" class="dashboard-btn">Ir a Pruebas CTF</a>
        <a href="#" class="dashboard-btn">Ver Reportes CTF</a>
        <a href="#" class="dashboard-btn">Dashboard CTF</a>

        <h3>Sección de CTF</h3>
        <div class="frames-container">
            <div class="frame-item">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="Imagen 1" class="frame-image">
                <h3>Prueba CTF 1</h3>
                <p>Descripción corta de la prueba CTF que se está mostrando aquí.</p>
                <button class="read-more-button">Leer más</button>
            </div>

            <div class="frame-item">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="Imagen 2" class="frame-image">
                <h3>Prueba CTF 2</h3>
                <p>Otra prueba CTF, con un poco más de descripción sobre el contenido.</p>
                <button class="read-more-button">Leer más</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="test-block">
            <h4>Próxima Prueba de CTF:</h4>
            <p>Descripción de la próxima prueba de CTF que los usuarios podrán tomar.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
